---
description: Contributing to idea-library
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md at the repo root. It is the single contract for every agent contributing here,
regardless of vendor. Nothing in this rule overrides it.

- index.json is the full catalog in one fetch — read it before writing anything.
- `npm run check` is exactly what CI runs. Zero dependencies.
- Never hand-edit a GENERATED file.
- Never commit secrets, .env files, local paths, personal data, or an un-allowlisted wallet address.
